From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mproton <mproton@localhost>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 02:39:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ir50_32: Don't build the tests without the dll.

Proton's "ir50_32: HACK: Don't build dll." removes dlls/ir50_32 from
configure.ac but keeps dlls/ir50_32/tests. wine-11.20's makedep looks up
the parent makefile of every test dll and crashes when it is missing,
so drop the tests too.
---
 configure.ac | 1 -
 1 file changed, 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/configure.ac b/configure.ac
index a23bc295863..4003c7a5992 100644
--- a/configure.ac
+++ b/configure.ac
@@ -2794,7 +2794,6 @@ WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(dlls/inseng)
 WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(dlls/iphlpapi)
 WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(dlls/iphlpapi/tests)
 WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(dlls/iprop)
-WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(dlls/ir50_32/tests)
 WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(dlls/irprops.cpl)
 WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(dlls/itircl)
 WINE_CONFIG_MAKEFILE(dlls/itss)
